\par\par \b \uc2 AT A GLANCE:  \highlight22\uc2 Japan Intervenes \highlight\uc2  To Stem Yen's Rise\b0\par\par\uc2 539 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 September 2010\par 19:55\par \uc2 Dow Jones News Service\par \uc2 DJ\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 THE EVENT: The Japanese government \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Wednesday for the first time in more than six years, selling yen to curb the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's strength. The dollar, which had earlier hit a 15-year low below Y83, quickly rose above Y85 on the wave of yen selling that totaled nearly $12 billion.\par \par \uc2 MORE \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  MAY BE ON THE HORIZON: Japanese officials hinted that Wednesday's action might not be the end of the effort. "When \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  changes rates, there will be new buyers and sellers and [we] respond to that continuously," an official at the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  said.\par \par \uc2 The markets may be in for a long slog, however: When \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , it sold an estimated Y35 trillion from January 2003 to March 2004. One study estimated the spending at around Y285 billion each time the government acted, compared with the Y1 trillion it spent Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 OPPOSITION TO \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 : The Group of Seven leading industrial nations, which include \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 , have generally agreed in recent years that direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  should be used only to counter alarmingly rapid \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  climbs, particularly those stemming from speculative attacks.\par \par \uc2 If the Bank of Japan keeps on selling yen on the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 's behalf, U.S. officials and others may start criticizing the Japanese move, making international relations on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets even frostier.\par \par \uc2 The Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  also makes it much more difficult for the U.S. to accuse China of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  manipulation by artificially holding down the yuan's value.\par \par \uc2 THE MARKETS:\par \par \uc2 - Several Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , including the Chinese yuan, fell against the dollar on the news.\par \par \uc2 - The euro ticked down only slightly against the dollar, trading at $1.3011 from $1.3020 late Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 - Japanese stocks surged, with the Nikkei Stock Average posting its biggest gain in over five weeks led by major exporters such as \uc2 Toyota Motor Corp\uc2 . (TM, 7203.TO) and \uc2 Sony Corp\uc2 . (SNE, 6758.TO).\par \par \uc2 - U.S. stocks climbed tentatively Wednesday as investors parsed mixed economic data and weighed the effects of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 - U.S. Treasury bond prices initially fell on the news of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but disappointing U.S. data then raised concern about the economy's health, boosting demand for safe assets.\par \par \uc2 For Dow Jones Newswires' complete coverage of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , search N/FRX. Stories include:\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par MONEY TALKS: \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Does Its Bit To Stir Global Balances Fight \par WSJ: \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Bucks Global Trend \par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Continues To Weaken Yen In NY Trading - Sources \par WORLD \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FOREX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 : Yen Drops; Investors On Alert For More \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par US Rep Levin: \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  'Deeply Disturbing' \par BOC Declines To Comment Following Japanese \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par FOCUS: \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Runs Risk Of International Criticism \par NY Fed Declines To Comment On \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Yen \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Launches Y1 Tln \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Yen Tumbles \par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  PM: \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  In \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  As Could Not Leave Market Alone Anymore \par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Govt Official: \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  In European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Market \par Asian Shares End Mostly Up; Tokyo Surges On Yen \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par WSJ: Yen \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Won't Affect Many Companies' Bottom Line \par BOJ To Let Yen From \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Slosh Around Market \par BOJ Noda: To Provide Ample Funds, Making Use Of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Funds \par  \f28 \