t in Asia.\par \par \uc2 -By Karen Johnson, Dow Jones Newswires; 416-306-2022; karen.johnson@dowjones.com [ 09-15-10 1109ET ]\par \par \uc2 1033 1074 1158 1863 1865 20714 28038 4164   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020100915e69f000bp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
